os de XM) y líneas de transmisión construidas,\nconsultado el 2026-11-11; la UPME no declara licencia y los presenta como informativos y aproximados. Departamentos: DANE, MGN 2025.\nMapa base: Midnight de RustGIS. Cómo se hizo: todo en RustGIS web (web.rustgis.app), con cuatro scripts: datos en PBF, Unique Values,\ntamaño por expresión (raíz de los MW) y layouts. Scripts: github.com/jgregoriorincon/30DayMapChallenge-2026","size":5.5,"color":[138,151,171,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":78,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":292.3,"w":186.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"#30DayMapChallenge 2026 · Día 12: Power · Hecho con RustGIS · rustgis.app","size":6.5,"color":[255,210,63,255],"bold":false,"align":"Right"}}}],"series":null,"next_id":79},{"name":"Day 12","width":210.0,"height":297.0,"elements":[{"id":2,"name":"Rectangle","x":0.0,"y":0.0,"w":210.0,"h":297.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[26,31,38,255],"outline":[26,31,38,255],"width":0.0}}},{"id":1,"name":"Map Frame","x":0.0,"y":29.0,"w":210.0,"h":197.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"MapFrame":{"map":"Energia","center":{"x":-73.05,"y":4.15},"scale":10000000.0,"shape":"Rectangle","grid":null,"extent_of":null}}},{"id":3,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":5.5,"w":186.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"30DAYMAPCHALLENGE · DAY 12 · POWER · COLOMBIA","size":7.5,"color":[255,210,63,255],"bold":false,"letter_spacing":2.5}}},{"id":4,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":10.0,"w":186.0,"h":12.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"The sun came late, and all at once","size":26.0,"color":[255,255,255,255],"bold":true}}},{"id":5,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":22.5,"w":186.0,"h":5.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Power plants on the national grid, in operation or in testing, and the transmission network","size":9.0,"color":[184,196,214,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":6,"name":"Text","x":10.0,"y":34.0,"w":55.0,"h":18.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"204","size":44.0,"color":[255,210,63,255],"bold":true}}},{"id":7,"name"